msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "BFpack"
msgstr "BFpack"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid ""
""
"A module for computing Bayes factors for equality, inequality, and order"
"constrained hypotheses."
msgstr ""
"Een module voor het berekenen van Bayes factoren voor gelijkheid-,"
"ongelijkheid- en ordeningsbeperkte hypothesen."

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "Dependent Variables"
msgstr "Afhankelijke variabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "Fixed Factors"
msgstr "Vaste factoren"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid ""
""
"Categorical grouping variables whose mean differences and interactions are"
"tested in the model."
msgstr ""
"Categorische groeperingsvariabelen waarvan de gemiddelde verschillen"
"en interacties in het model worden getoetst."

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "Covariaten"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid ""
""
"Continuous predictors to adjust for in the analysis. Adding covariates turns"
"the model into an ANCOVA or MANCOVA."
msgstr ""
"Continue voorspellers waarvoor in de analyse wordt gecorrigeerd. Door"
"covariaten toe te voegen verandert het model in een ANCOVA of MANCOVA."

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "μ"
msgstr "μ"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid ""
""
"Assign the variables whose correlations will be tested, plus optional grouping"
"and covariate variables."
msgstr ""
"Wijs de variabelen toe waarvan de correlaties worden getoetst, plus"
"optionele groeperings- en covariaatvariabelen."

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid ""
""
"Select at least two variables whose correlations will be estimated and tested."
"Supported associations include product-moment, polychoric, tetrachoric,"
"polyserial, and biserial correlations."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer ten minste twee variabelen waarvan de correlaties worden"
"geschat en getoetst. Ondersteunde associaties omvatten"
"product-moment-, polychorische, tetrachorische, polyseriële en"
"biseriële correlaties."

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Grouping Variable"
msgstr "Groeperingsvariabele"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid ""
""
"Optional nominal grouping variable for testing independent correlations across"
"groups."
msgstr ""
"Optionele nominale groeperingsvariabele voor het toetsen van"
"onafhankelijke correlaties tussen groepen."

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "Covariaten"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Optional covariates to control for when estimating the correlations."
msgstr ""
"Optionele covariaten om voor te controleren bij het schatten van de"
"correlaties."

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "ρ"
msgstr "ρ"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "each correlation coefficient"
msgstr "elke correlatiecoëfficiënt"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid ""
""
"Assign continuous dependent variables and predictor variables for the linear"
"regression model."
msgstr ""
"Wijs continue afhankelijke variabelen en voorspellervariabelen toe"
"voor het lineaire regressiemodel."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "Dependent Variables"
msgstr "Afhankelijke variabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid ""
""
"One or more continuous outcome variables. Multiple dependent variables fit a"
"multivariate multiple regression."
msgstr ""
"Een of meer continue uitkomstvariabelen. Meerdere afhankelijke"
"variabelen passen een multivariate meervoudige regressie."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "Predictor Variables"
msgstr "Voorspellervariabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid ""
""
"Predictor variables for the regression model. Nominal and ordinal predictors"
"are dummy coded automatically when needed."
msgstr ""
"Voorspellervariabelen voor het regressiemodel. Nominale en ordinale"
"voorspellers worden indien nodig automatisch dummy-gecodeerd."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "β"
msgstr "β"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "each regression coefficient"
msgstr "elke regressiecoëfficiënt"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid ""
""
"Assign an ordinal or nominal dependent variable and predictor variables for"
"the logistic regression model."
msgstr ""
"Wijs een ordinale of nominale afhankelijke variabele en"
"voorspellervariabelen toe voor het logistische regressiemodel."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "Afhankelijke variabele"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid ""
""
"Outcome variable for the logistic model. Ordinal outcomes fit an ordered"
"logistic regression; binary nominal outcomes fit a binary logistic regression."
msgstr ""
"Uitkomstvariabele voor het logistische model. Ordinale uitkomsten"
"passen een ordelijke logistische regressie; binaire nominale"
"uitkomsten passen een binaire logistische regressie."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "Predictor Variables"
msgstr "Voorspellervariabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "Predictor variables for the logistic regression model."
msgstr "Voorspellervariabelen voor het logistische regressiemodel."

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "β"
msgstr "β"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "each logistic regression coefficient"
msgstr "elke logistische regressiecoëfficiënt"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid ""
""
"Assign one continuous outcome variable and one nominal grouping variable for"
"the independent samples t-test."
msgstr ""
"Wijs één continue uitkomstvariabele en één nominale"
"groeperingsvariabele toe voor de t-toets voor onafhankelijke"
"steekproeven."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Continuous outcome variable to compare between the two groups."
msgstr ""
"Continue uitkomstvariabele die tussen de twee groepen wordt"
"vergeleken."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Grouping Variable"
msgstr "Groeperingsvariabele"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Nominal variable defining the two independent groups."
msgstr "Nominale variabele die de twee onafhankelijke groepen definieert."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "difference"
msgstr "verschil"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "the group mean difference"
msgstr "het gemiddelde verschil tussen de groepen"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid ""
""
"Assign the continuous variables whose means will be tested jointly in the"
"multivariate t-test."
msgstr ""
"Wijs de continue variabelen toe waarvan de gemiddelden gezamenlijk"
"worden getoetst in de multivariate t-toets."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Continuous variables whose means are tested simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Continue variabelen waarvan de gemiddelden gelijktijdig worden"
"getoetst."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "μ"
msgstr "μ"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "the means of the selected variables"
msgstr "de gemiddelden van de geselecteerde variabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Specify test value"
msgstr "Toetswaarde specificeren"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid ""
""
"Set the reference mean for each selected variable in the standard hypothesis"
"test."
msgstr ""
"Stel het referentiegemiddelde in voor elke geselecteerde variabele in"
"de standaard hypothesetoets."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Test value for the mean of %1."
msgstr "Toetswaarde voor het gemiddelde van %1."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "Assign one continuous variable for the one-sample t-test."
msgstr "Wijs één continue variabele toe voor de t-toets voor één steekproef."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variabele"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "Continuous variable whose mean will be tested."
msgstr "Continue variabele waarvan het gemiddelde zal worden getoetst."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "mu"
msgstr "mu"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "the population mean"
msgstr "het populatiegemiddelde"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "Assign the two continuous variables that form the paired comparison."
msgstr ""
"Wijs de twee continue variabelen toe die de gepaarde vergelijking"
"vormen."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "Pair"
msgstr "Paar"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "Pair the two continuous variables whose mean difference will be tested."
msgstr ""
"Paar de twee continue variabelen waarvan het gemiddelde verschil zal"
"worden getoetst."

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "difference"
msgstr "verschil"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "the mean difference between the paired variables"
msgstr "het gemiddelde verschil tussen de gepaarde variabelen"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid ""
""
"Assign one outcome variable and one grouping variable for the variance"
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"Wijs één uitkomstvariabele en één groeperingsvariabele toe voor de"
"variantievergelijking."

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare variabelen uit de dataset die aan de analyse kunnen worden"
"toegewezen."

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variabele"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Outcome variable whose group variances will be compared."
msgstr ""
"Uitkomstvariabele waarvan de groepsvarianties zullen worden"
"vergeleken."

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Grouping Variable"
msgstr "Groeperingsvariabele"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Nominal variable defining the groups whose variances are compared."
msgstr ""
"Nominale variabele die de groepen definieert waarvan de varianties"
"worden vergeleken."

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "the group variances"
msgstr "de groepsvarianties"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "<b>Manual Hypothesis Test</b>"
msgstr "<b>Handmatige hypothesetoets</b>"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Click for more information"
msgstr "Klik voor meer informatie"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid ""
""
"List of manually specified hypotheses. Use parameter names from the Parameters"
"box, assign prior weights, and tick Include for the hypotheses that should be"
"tested."
msgstr ""
"Lijst van handmatig gespecificeerde hypothesen. Gebruik parameternamen"
"uit het vak Parameters, ken a-priori-gewichten toe en vink Opnemen aan"
"voor de hypothesen die moeten worden getoetst."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Hypotheses"
msgstr "Hypothesen"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Prior weight"
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Include"
msgstr "Opnemen"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "H%1:"
msgstr "H%1:"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid ""
""
"Enter a constrained hypothesis using the shown parameter names, for example a"
"= 0, a > 0, or a > b > 0."
msgstr ""
"Voer een beperkte hypothese in met behulp van de getoonde"
"parameternamen, bijvoorbeeld a = 0, a > 0 of a > b > 0."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Prior weight for this manual hypothesis."
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht voor deze handmatige hypothese."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Include this manual hypothesis in the analysis."
msgstr "Neem deze handmatige hypothese op in de analyse."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Complement hypothesis"
msgstr "Complementhypothese"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Prior weight assigned to the complement hypothesis."
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht toegewezen aan de complementhypothese."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Include the complement hypothesis in the hypothesis set."
msgstr "Neem de complementhypothese op in de hypothesenverzameling."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "mu"
msgstr "mu"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the means of the selected variables relative to their test values"
msgstr ""
"de gemiddelden van de geselecteerde variabelen ten opzichte van hun"
"toetswaarden"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the group variances"
msgstr "de groepsvarianties"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "ρ"
msgstr "ρ"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the correlation coefficients"
msgstr "de correlatiecoëfficiënten"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the parameter %1"
msgstr "de parameter %1"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "<b>Standard Hypothesis Test</b>"
msgstr "<b>Standaard hypothesetoets</b>"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Tests whether each selected mean equals its test value or differs from it."
msgstr ""
"Toetst of elk geselecteerd gemiddelde gelijk is aan de toetswaarde of"
"ervan verschilt."

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Tests whether the group variances are equal or unequal."
msgstr "Toetst of de groepsvarianties gelijk of ongelijk zijn."

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid ""
""
"Tests whether %1 is equal to, smaller than, or larger than the specified test"
"value."
msgstr ""
"Toetst of %1 gelijk is aan, kleiner is dan of groter is dan de"
"gespecificeerde toetswaarde."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Tests whether %1 is equal to, smaller than, or larger than zero."
msgstr "Toetst of %1 gelijk is aan, kleiner is dan of groter is dan nul."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H0: "
msgstr "H0:"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H±: "
msgstr "H±:"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H0: Equal variances"
msgstr "H0: Gelijke varianties"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H±: Unequal variances"
msgstr "H±: Ongelijke varianties"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H-: "
msgstr "H-:"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H+: "
msgstr "H+:"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Hypotheses"
msgstr "Hypothesen"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Test value"
msgstr "Toetswaarde"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Prior weights"
msgstr "A-priori-gewichten"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Reference value used in the standard hypothesis test for %1."
msgstr "Referentiewaarde gebruikt in de standaard hypothesetoets voor %1."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid ""
""
"Prior weight for the first standard hypothesis. Larger values assign more"
"prior probability to that hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"A-priori-gewicht voor de eerste standaardhypothese. Grotere waarden"
"kennen meer a-priori-waarschijnlijkheid toe aan die hypothese."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Prior weight for the second standard hypothesis."
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht voor de tweede standaardhypothese."

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Prior weight for the third standard hypothesis."
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht voor de derde standaardhypothese."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opties"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Configure Bayes factor reporting, tables, plots, uncertainty intervals,"
"sampling settings, and model-specific options."
msgstr ""
"Configureer de rapportage van Bayes factoren, tabellen, grafieken,"
"onzekerheidsintervallen, samplinginstellingen en modelspecifieke"
"opties."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Bayes Factor"
msgstr "Bayes factor"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Log scale"
msgstr "Logschaal"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Report Bayes factors on the natural logarithm scale."
msgstr "Rapporteer Bayes factoren op de natuurlijke logaritmeschaal."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Bayes factor type"
msgstr "Type Bayes factor"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Choose how the default fractional Bayes factor prior is centered for"
"hypothesis testing."
msgstr ""
"Kies hoe de standaard fractionele Bayes factor prior wordt gecentreerd"
"voor hypothesetoetsing."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Fractional Bayes factor"
msgstr "Fractionele Bayes factor"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Uses the default fractional Bayes factor, with the fractional prior centered"
"at the maximum likelihood estimate."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikt de standaard fractionele Bayes factor, met de fractionele"
"prior gecentreerd op de maximum likelihood schatting."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Adjusted fractional Bayes factor"
msgstr "Aangepaste fractionele Bayes factor"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Uses the adjusted fractional Bayes factor, with the fractional prior centered"
"at a null value."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikt de aangepaste fractionele Bayes factor, met de fractionele"
"prior gecentreerd op een nulwaarde."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "Tabellen"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Select which result tables should be included in the output."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer welke resultaat-tabellen in de uitvoer moeten worden"
"opgenomen."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Standard hypotheses: View BFs"
msgstr "Standaardhypothesen: BF's bekijken"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Show the Bayes factor table for the standard hypothesis test."
msgstr "Toon de Bayes factortabel voor de standaard hypothesetoets."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Manual hypotheses: Computation BFs"
msgstr "Handmatige hypothesen: BF's berekenen"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Show the table with fit, complexity, and Bayes factor components for the"
"manual hypotheses."
msgstr ""
"Toon de tabel met fit, complexiteit en Bayes factor-componenten voor"
"de handmatige hypothesen."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "Schattingen"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Show the parameter estimates table with uncertainty intervals."
msgstr "Toon de tabel met parameterschattingen en onzekerheidsintervallen."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "Grafieken"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Select which plots should be included in the output."
msgstr "Selecteer welke grafieken in de uitvoer moeten worden opgenomen."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Manual hypotheses plots"
msgstr "Grafieken handmatige hypothesen"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plot the prior and posterior probabilities of the manual hypotheses."
msgstr ""
"Grafiek van de a-priori- en a-posteriori-waarschijnlijkheden van de"
"handmatige hypothesen."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior and posterior plot"
msgstr "A-priori- en a-posteriori-grafiek"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plot the prior and posterior distributions of the sampled correlations."
msgstr ""
"Grafiek van de a-priori- en a-posteriori-verdelingen van de gesamplede"
"correlaties."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Estimation info"
msgstr "Schattingsinformatie"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Add estimation summaries to the prior and posterior correlation plot."
msgstr ""
"Voeg schattingssamenvattingen toe aan de a-priori- en"
"a-posteriori-correlatiegrafiek."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Testing info"
msgstr "Toetsingsinformatie"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Add testing summaries for the constrained correlation hypotheses to the plot."
msgstr ""
"Voeg toetsingssamenvattingen voor de beperkte correlatiehypothesen toe"
"aan de grafiek."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Traceplot"
msgstr "Traceplot"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plot the MCMC sampling traces for the correlations."
msgstr "Grafiek van de MCMC-samplingtraces voor de correlaties."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Additional Options"
msgstr "Extra opties"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Set interval levels, standardization, sampling details, and other model-"
"specific analysis settings."
msgstr ""
"Stel intervalniveaus, standaardisatie, samplingdetails en andere"
"modelspecifieke analyse-instellingen in."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Uncertainty interval level"
msgstr "Niveau van het onzekerheidsinterval"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Coverage level of the reported uncertainty interval, for example 95%."
msgstr ""
"Dekkingsniveau van het gerapporteerde onzekerheidsinterval,"
"bijvoorbeeld 95%."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Standardize continuous variables"
msgstr "Continue variabelen standaardiseren"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Standardize continuous variables before fitting the model."
msgstr "Standaardiseer continue variabelen voordat het model wordt geschat."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Variances"
msgstr "Varianties"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Assume equal or unequal group variances in the independent samples t-test."
msgstr ""
"Ga uit van gelijke of ongelijke groepsvarianties in de t-toets voor"
"onafhankelijke steekproeven."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Equal"
msgstr "Gelijk"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Assume the two groups have equal variances."
msgstr "Ga ervan uit dat de twee groepen gelijke varianties hebben."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Unequal"
msgstr "Ongelijk"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Allow the two groups to have different variances. Bayes factors are then"
"approximated by iterative sampling."
msgstr ""
"Sta toe dat de twee groepen verschillende varianties hebben. Bayes"
"factoren worden dan benaderd door iteratieve sampling."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "No. iterations for BF computation"
msgstr "Aantal iteraties voor BF-berekening"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Number of iterations used when Bayes factors are computed by sampling."
msgstr ""
"Aantal iteraties dat wordt gebruikt wanneer Bayes factoren door"
"sampling worden berekend."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "No. iterations for MCMC"
msgstr "Aantal iteraties voor MCMC"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Number of posterior draws used to estimate the correlation model."
msgstr ""
"Aantal a-posteriori-tekeningen dat wordt gebruikt om het"
"correlatiemodel te schatten."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Sampling Method"
msgstr "Samplingmethode"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Sampling algorithm used for posterior estimation of the correlation matrix."
msgstr ""
"Samplingalgoritme dat wordt gebruikt voor a-posteriori-schatting van"
"de correlatiematrix."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "LKJ"
msgstr "LKJ"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Use the LKJ method to sample correlation matrices."
msgstr "Gebruik de LKJ-methode om correlatiematrices te samplen."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "LD"
msgstr "LD"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Use the Liu-Daniels method to sample correlation matrices."
msgstr "Gebruik de Liu-Daniels-methode om correlatiematrices te samplen."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Nugget"
msgstr "Nugget"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Scaling factor used with the LD sampler to keep sampled correlations away from"
"plus or minus one when needed."
msgstr ""
"Schalingsfactor die bij de LD-sampler wordt gebruikt om gesamplede"
"correlaties indien nodig van plus of min één weg te houden."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Exclude intercept from the model"
msgstr "Intercept uit het model uitsluiten"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Remove the intercept from the fitted model. This is often appropriate for"
"ANOVA-style parameterizations."
msgstr ""
"Verwijder het intercept uit het geschatte model. Dit is vaak geschikt"
"voor ANOVA-achtige parametrisaties."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Fix the random number seed to make the analysis exactly reproducible."
msgstr ""
"Stel de seed van de willekeurige getallen in om de analyse exact"
"reproduceerbaar te maken."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Interaction terms"
msgstr "Interactietermen"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Select which candidate two-way interaction terms should be added to the model."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer welke kandidaat-tweeweg-interactietermen aan het model"
"moeten worden toegevoegd."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Include"
msgstr "Opnemen"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Available two-way interaction terms generated from the selected predictors,"
"factors, or covariates."
msgstr ""
"Beschikbare tweeweg-interactietermen die zijn gegenereerd uit de"
"geselecteerde voorspellers, factoren of covariaten."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Include this interaction term in the model."
msgstr "Neem deze interactieterm op in het model."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Effects"
msgstr "Effecten"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
""
"Prior weights for the omnibus hypotheses that main and interaction effects are"
"absent or present in the ANOVA model."
msgstr ""
"A-priori-gewichten voor de omnibushypothesen dat hoofd- en"
"interactie-effecten afwezig of aanwezig zijn in het ANOVA-model."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight"
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Main zero effect"
msgstr "Hoofdeffect nul"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that a main effect is absent."
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht voor de hypothese dat een hoofdeffect afwezig is."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Main non-zero effect"
msgstr "Hoofdeffect niet nul"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that a main effect is present."
msgstr "A-priori-gewicht voor de hypothese dat een hoofdeffect aanwezig is."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Interaction zero effect"
msgstr "Interactie-effect nul"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that an interaction effect is absent."
msgstr ""
"A-priori-gewicht voor de hypothese dat een interactie-effect afwezig"
"is."

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Interaction non-zero effect"
msgstr "Interactie-effect niet nul"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that an interaction effect is present."
msgstr ""
"A-priori-gewicht voor de hypothese dat een interactie-effect aanwezig"
"is."

msgctxt "ParametersWindow|"
msgid ""
""
"Shows the parameter names that are currently available for manual equality and"
"order constraints. The labels depend on the selected variables and the fitted"
"model."
msgstr ""
"Toont de parameternamen die momenteel beschikbaar zijn voor handmatige"
"gelijkheids- en ordeningsbeperkingen. De labels hangen af van de"
"geselecteerde variabelen en het geschatte model."

msgctxt "ParametersWindow|"
msgid "<b>Parameters:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Parameters:</b>"

msgctxt "ParametersWindow|"
msgid ""
""
"The parameters that can be tested in the manual hypothesis test appear here"
"after you assign variables to the analysis."
msgstr ""
"De parameters die in de handmatige hypothesetoets kunnen worden"
"getoetst, verschijnen hier nadat u variabelen aan de analyse hebt"
"toegewezen."
